WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:17.581
Mrs. Tiggywinkle saw some potato soup.

2
00:00:17.582 --> 00:00:19.825
She put it on the table.

3
00:00:19.826 --> 00:00:22.984
"Cousin, eat this soup," she said.

4
00:00:22.985 --> 00:00:25.172
"You must get well."

5
00:00:25.173 --> 00:00:28.757
"That is Simpkin's lunch," the tailor said.

6
00:00:28.758 --> 00:00:30.802
"He is my friend.

7
00:00:30.803 --> 00:00:38.154
He went to buy buttons for this coat."

8
00:00:38.155 --> 00:00:41.997
"Simpkin will not mind," Mrs. Tiggywinkle said.

9
00:00:41.998 --> 00:00:58.039
"Please. You must eat."

10
00:00:58.040 --> 00:01:10.878
The tailor ate the soup.

11
00:01:10.879 --> 00:01:13.597
Soon Simpkin came back.

12
00:01:13.598 --> 00:01:15.935
He rubbed his belly.

13
00:01:15.936 --> 00:01:18.890
"It's time for lunch," he said.

14
00:01:18.891 --> 00:01:28.353
"And I am very hungry."

15
00:01:28.354 --> 00:01:31.965
Then Simpkin spotted the empty pot.

16
00:01:31.966 --> 00:01:35.201
"My lunch!" he cried.

17
00:01:35.202 --> 00:01:45.296
"I will make more potato soup," Mrs. Tiggywinkle said.

18
00:01:45.297 --> 00:01:50.450
She looked around.

19
00:01:50.451 --> 00:01:57.246
But there were no more potatoes.

20
00:01:57.247 --> 00:02:00.627
"Simpkin." The tailor stood up.

21
00:02:00.628 --> 00:02:02.963
"Where are the buttons?"

22
00:02:02.964 --> 00:02:05.177
Simpkin frowned.

23
00:02:05.178 --> 00:02:09.083
"The shop was closed," he said.

24
00:02:09.084 --> 00:02:13.302
Simpkin stomped over to the fire.

25
00:02:13.303 --> 00:02:16.927
"So we have no buttons!" he said.

26
00:02:16.928 --> 00:02:21.747
He folded his arms and sat down.

27
00:02:21.748 --> 00:02:27.658
"Oh no." The tailor sank into the chair.

28
00:02:27.659 --> 00:02:29.866
"This is terrible.

29
00:02:29.867 --> 00:02:38.824
The mayor's coat must have buttons!"

